    "https://candidate.hr-manager.net/Agent/Subscription.aspx?customer=statensrekrutteringsloesning_tr&departmentid=19064": {
      "title": "Talentech",
      "description": "This website uses cookies. This page displays all cookies that may appear on the candidate.hr-manager.net domain, and the list below therefore does not represent cookies present on all sites. If you allow cookies, you consent to Talentech and third parties storing the cookies you have selected. If you do not give consent, we will only store the cookies necessary for you to use the site. You can always change your consent by clicking the button in the bottom left corner. Introduction Welcome to Talentech.com (\"we,\" \"our,\" \"us\"). We use cookies and similar technologies on our website to enhance your browsing experience, analyze traffic, and improve our services. This Cookie Policy explains what cookies are, how we use them, and the choices you have regarding their use. What are cookies? Cookies are small text files stored on your device (computer, tablet, smartphone) when you visit a website. They allow the website to recognize your device and remember your preferences or actions over time. Your choices regarding cookies You decide what cookies we can by managing your preferences in the cookie banner of this website. You can always reach the cookie banner and change your preferences by clicking the symbol in the left corner. Changes to this cookie policy We may update this cookie policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices. Any changes will be posted on this page. Any questions? If you have any questions about this Cookie Policy, please contact us at legal@talentech.com Your consent applies to the following domains: candidate.hr-manager.net/ Your current state: Deny. Your current state: Do not sell or share my personal information. Your current state: Allow selection (Necessary , Preferences , Statistics , Marketing ). Your current state: Allow all. Your consent ID: 0 Consent date: Change your consent | Withdraw your consent Do not sell or share my personal information Cookie declaration last updated on 24/08/2026 by Cookiebot : Necessary (6) Necessary cookies help make a website usable by enabling basic functions like page navigation and access to secure areas of the website. The website cannot function properly without these cookies. Name Provider Purpose Maximum Storage Duration Type ARRAffinity styleguide.hrmts.net Used to distribute traffic to the website on several servers in order to optimise response times. Session HTTP Cookie ARRAffinitySameSite styleguide.hrmts.net Used to distribute traffic to the website on several servers in order to optimise response times. Session HTTP Cookie CookieConsent Cookiebot Stores the user's cookie consent state for the current domain 186 days HTTP Cookie HRMTS.AdReferrer Talentech ApS Helps improve the candidate’s browsing flow by preventing duplicate steps related to how they reached the site 1 day HTTP Cookie HRMTS.Browserwarning Talentech ApS Stores the information about the warning message given to the user for recommended browser. 3 months HTTP Cookie HRMTS.Session.Candidate Talentech ApS Identification of job applicants during return visits. Session HTTP Cookie Preferences (12) Preference cookies enable a website to remember information that changes the way the website behaves or looks, like your preferred language or the region that you are in. Name Provider Purpose Maximum Storage Duration Type (unavngiven)          [x2] Filestack Used in conjunction with external content API. The cookie serves to inform the user about the status of the download/upload. Session HTTP Cookie __cf_bm Vimeo Used to determine whether the user is a real person or a software robot - This enables the creation of valid reports about the use of the website. 1 day HTTP Cookie __sharethis_cookie_test__ Sharethis This cookie determines whether the browser accepts cookies. Session HTTP Cookie __VAST__ assets.ziggeo.com Necessary for the implementation of video-content on the website. Persistent HTML Local Storage CONSENT          [x2] Google YouTube Shows whether the visitor has selected cookies in the marketing category. The cookie is necessary for compliance with the GDPR regulations. 2 years HTTP Cookie fp-message-queue Filestack Used in conjunction with external content API. The cookie serves to inform the user about the status of the download/upload. Persistent HTML Local Storage fp-message-ready Filestack Used in conjunction with external content API. The cookie serves to inform the user about the status of the download/upload. Persistent HTML Local Storage rc::c Google This cookie is used to distinguish between humans and bots. Session HTML Local Storage sid bot.zmashsolutions.com Preserves user state across page queries. 1 day HTTP Cookie z_uid https://bot.zmashsolutions.com/ Storbritannien (tilstrækkelig) Sikkert tredjeland under GDPR (EU) 399 days HTTP Cookie Statistics (21) Statistic cookies help website owners to understand how visitors interact with websites by collecting and reporting information anonymously. Name Provider Purpose Maximum Storage Duration Type _ga HR Manager Registers a unique ID that is used to keep statistics on how the visitor uses the website. 399 days HTTP Cookie _ga_# HR Manager Registers a unique ID that is used to keep statistics on how the visitor uses the website. 399 days HTTP Cookie _sp_id.# Talentech ApS Collects data on the user's visits to the website, such as the number of visits, average time spent on the website and what pages have been loaded with the purpose of generating reports for optimising the website content. 5 days HTTP Cookie _sp_id.bcbe Talentech ApS Pending 1 day HTTP Cookie _sp_root_domain_test_#          [x2] Ontame.io Registers statistical data on users' behaviour on the website. Used for internal analytics by the website operator. Session HTTP Cookie _sp_ses.# Talentech ApS Used by Snowplow Analytics to track how users are browsing and engaging with a website. 5 days HTTP Cookie _sp_ses.bcbe Talentech ApS Pending 1 day HTTP Cookie AWSALB Siteimprove Contains information about which server cluster the user uses. This is used in conjunction with load-balancing to optimize the user experience on the website. 7 days HTTP Cookie AWSALBCORS Siteimprove Contains information about which server cluster the user uses. This is used in conjunction with load-balancing to optimize the user experience on the website. 7 days HTTP Cookie DEVICE_INFO YouTube Used to collect data regarding the user's interaction with embedded content. 179 days HTTP Cookie global.siteimproveanalytics.io Siteimprove Contains information about which server cluster the user uses. This is used in conjunction with load-balancing to optimize the user experience on the website. 7 days HTTP Cookie image.aspx Siteimprove Pending Persistent Pixel Tracker nmstat HR Manager Ireland (sufficient) Secure third country under GDPR (EU) 1 year HTTP Cookie ontame_id.7000          [x2] Ontame.io Pending 1 year HTTP Cookie rc::a Google This cookie is used to distinguish between humans and bots. This is beneficial for the website, in order to make valid reports on the use of their website. Persistent HTML Local Storage snowplowOutQueue_#_post2 Ontame.io Registers statistical data on users' behaviour on the website. Used for internal analytics by the website operator. Persistent HTML Local Storage snowplowOutQueue_#_post2.expires Ontame.io Registers statistical data on users' behaviour on the website. Used for internal analytics by the website operator. Persistent HTML Local Storage snowplowOutQueue__ot_sp_clj_get Ontame.io Registers statistical data on users' behaviour on the website. Used for internal analytics by the website operator. Persistent HTML Local Storage sp Ontame.io Registers statistical data on users' behaviour on the website. Used for internal analytics by the website operator. 1 year HTTP Cookie Marketing (18) Marketing cookies are used to track visitors across websites. The intention is to display ads that are relevant and engaging for the individual user and thereby more valuable for publishers and third party advertisers. Name Provider Purpose Maximum Storage Duration Type __Secure-ROLLOUT_TOKEN YouTube Used to track user’s interaction with embedded content. 180 days HTTP Cookie __Secure-YEC YouTube Stores the user's video player preferences using embedded YouTube video Session HTTP Cookie __Secure-YNID YouTube Used to track user’s interaction with embedded content. 180 days HTTP Cookie _fbp          [x2] Meta Platforms, Inc. https://socialrecruiting.jobtip.se Used by Facebook to deliver a series of advertisement products such as real time bidding from third party advertisers. 3 months HTTP Cookie _gat Google Used to send data to Google Analytics about the visitor's device and behavior. Tracks the visitor across devices and marketing channels. 1 day HTTP Cookie _gid Google Used to send data to Google Analytics about the visitor's device and behavior. Tracks the visitor across devices and marketing channels. 1 day HTTP Cookie LAST_RESULT_ENTRY_KEY YouTube Used to track user’s interaction with embedded content. Session HTTP Cookie lastExternalReferrer Meta Platforms, Inc. Detects how the user reached the website by registering their last URL-address. Persistent HTML Local Storage lastExternalReferrerTime Meta Platforms, Inc. Detects how the user reached the website by registering their last URL-address. Persistent HTML Local Storage LogsDatabaseV2:V#||LogsRequestsStore YouTube Used to track user’s interaction with embedded content. Persistent IndexedDB TESTCOOKIESENABLED YouTube Used to track user’s interaction with embedded content. 1 day HTTP Cookie VISITOR_INFO1_LIVE YouTube Tries to estimate the users' bandwidth on pages with integrated YouTube videos. 180 days HTTP Cookie YSC YouTube Attempts to estimate user bandwidth on pages with embedded YouTube video. Session HTTP Cookie yt-icons-last-purged YouTube Necessary for the implementation and functionality of YouTube video-content on the website. Persistent HTML Local Storage ytidb::LAST_RESULT_ENTRY_KEY YouTube Used to track user’s interaction with embedded content. Persistent HTML Local Storage ytidb::LAST_RESULT_ENTRY_KEY YouTube Saves the user's video player preferences when playing an embedded YouTube video Session HTTP Cookie YtIdbMeta#databases YouTube Used to track user’s interaction with embedded content. Persistent IndexedDB Unclassified (2) Unclassified cookies are cookies that we are in the process of classifying, together with the providers of individual cookies. Name Provider Purpose Maximum Storage Duration Type oiosamlSession Talentech ApS Pending Session HTTP Cookie ontame_ses.7000 Ontame.io Pending 1 day HTTP Cookie Talentech - Tilmeld jobagent Samtykke Detaljer [#IABV2SETTINGS#] Om Denne hjemmeside bruger cookies Denne side viser alle cookies som kan fremkomme på candidate.hr-manager.net domænet og listen herunder er derfor ikke cookies som fremgår hos alle. Hvis du tillader cookies, accepterer du at Talentech og tredjeparter, gemmer de cookies, som du har valgt. Hvis du ikke giver samtykke, vil vi kun gemme de cookies, som er nødvendige for at du kan bruge siden. Du kan altid ændre dit samtykke ved at klikke på knappen nederst i venstre hjørne. [#GPC_BANNER_ICON#] [#GPC_TOAST_TEXT#] Samtykkevalg Nødvendig Præferencer Statistik Marketing Vis detaljer Detaljer Nødvendig 6 Nødvendige cookies hjælper med at gøre en hjemmeside brugbar ved at aktivere grundlæggende funktioner såsom side-navigation og adgang til sikre områder af hjemmesiden. Hjemmesiden kan ikke fungere ordentligt uden disse cookies. Cookiebot 1 Få mere at vide om denne udbyder CookieConsent Gemmer brugerens cookie-samtykke-tilstand for det aktuelle domæne. Maksimal opbevaringstid : 186 dage Type : HTTP Cookie Talentech ApS 3 Få mere at vide om denne udbyder HRMTS.AdReferrer Hjælper med at give en bedre browsingoplevelse ved at undgå gentagelser af trin relateret til hvordan kandidaten kom til vores hjemmeside. Maksimal opbevaringstid : 1 dag Type : HTTP Cookie HRMTS.Browserwarning Stores the information about the warning message given to the user for recommended browser. Maksimal opbevaringstid : 3 mdr. Type : HTTP Cookie HRMTS.Session.Candidate Identifikation af jobansøger ved gentagne besøg. Maksimal opbevaringstid : Session Type : HTTP Cookie styleguide.hrmts.net 2 ARRAffinity Anvendes til at fordele trafikken på hjemmesiden over flere servere for at optimere svartider. Maksimal opbevaringstid : Session Type : HTTP Cookie ARRAffinitySameSite Anvendes til at fordele trafikken på hjemmesiden over flere servere for at optimere svartider. Maksimal opbevaringstid : Session Type : HTTP Cookie Præferencer 12 Præference cookies gør det muligt for en hjemmeside at huske oplysninger, der ændrer den måde hjemmesiden ser ud eller opfører sig på. F.eks. dit foretrukne sprog, eller den region, du befinder dig i. Filestack 4 Få mere at vide om denne udbyder (unavngiven) [x2] Benyttes i forbindelse med ekstern indhold-API. Cookien tjener til at informere brugeren om statusen for download/upload. Maksimal opbevaringstid : Session Type : HTTP Cookie fp-message-queue Benyttes i forbindelse med ekstern indhold-API. Cookien tjener til at informere brugeren om statusen for download/upload. Maksimal opbevaringstid : Permanent Type : Lokalt HTML-lager fp-message-ready Benyttes i forbindelse med ekstern indhold-API. Cookien tjener til at informere brugeren om statusen for download/upload. Maksimal opbevaringstid : Permanent Type : Lokalt HTML-lager Google 1 Få mere at vide om denne udbyder Nogle af de data, der indsamles af denne udbyder, er til personalisering og måling af reklameeffektivitet. Udbyderen kan bruge IP-adresserne til måling og personalisering af annoncer. rc::c Benyttes til at bestemme, om brugeren er en virkelig person eller en robot. Maksimal opbevaringstid : Session Type : Lokalt HTML-lager Sharethis 1 Få mere at vide om denne udbyder __sharethis_cookie_test__ Denne cookie benyttes til at finde ud af, om den besøgende